{"3646020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ultimate Drummer", "steam_appid": 3646020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4795930], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate Drummer is an action-platformer DRPG where you play as a lone drummer on a sacred quest to restore harmony to a fractured world. Use a fully playable step-sequencer drum kit to reshape reality, awaken lost musicians, and bring music back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven progression</strong>: unfold the mythos of the music Gods and restore harmony through ritual, rhythm, platforming, and combat. 2-3 hours of gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/7e75322e7c2c49d26c236e2c06bc05bf.poster.avif?t=1782390627\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/7e75322e7c2c49d26c236e2c06bc05bf.webm?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/7e75322e7c2c49d26c236e2c06bc05bf.mp4?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully playable step-sequencer drum kit</strong>: create rhythms freely and shape the world through tempo and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/595bf4da9591a36dbe5d6baed22b8def.poster.avif?t=1782390627\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/595bf4da9591a36dbe5d6baed22b8def.webm?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/595bf4da9591a36dbe5d6baed22b8def.mp4?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep character customization</strong>: create your own drummer with a robust character creator, and find clothing pieces to evolve your look throughout the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/c58d3b07e72bb3439e23dc49f794be32.poster.avif?t=1782390627\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/c58d3b07e72bb3439e23dc49f794be32.webm?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/c58d3b07e72bb3439e23dc49f794be32.mp4?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-ended musical sandbox</strong>: Sequence up to 6 musicians simultaneously to create your own masterful compositions, with animations synced to your every note.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/69701794c413a0509c2a903d8c0e8f2c.poster.avif?t=1782390627\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/69701794c413a0509c2a903d8c0e8f2c.webm?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/69701794c413a0509c2a903d8c0e8f2c.mp4?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimate Drummer is an action-platformer DRPG where you play as a lone drummer on a sacred quest to restore harmony to a fractured world. Use a fully playable step-sequencer drum kit to reshape reality, awaken lost musicians, and bring music back to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative-driven progression</strong>: unfold the mythos of the music Gods and restore harmony through ritual, rhythm, platforming, and combat. 2-3 hours of gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/7e75322e7c2c49d26c236e2c06bc05bf.poster.avif?t=1782390627\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/7e75322e7c2c49d26c236e2c06bc05bf.webm?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/7e75322e7c2c49d26c236e2c06bc05bf.mp4?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully playable step-sequencer drum kit</strong>: create rhythms freely and shape the world through tempo and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/595bf4da9591a36dbe5d6baed22b8def.poster.avif?t=1782390627\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/595bf4da9591a36dbe5d6baed22b8def.webm?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/595bf4da9591a36dbe5d6baed22b8def.mp4?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep character customization</strong>: create your own drummer with a robust character creator, and find clothing pieces to evolve your look throughout the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/c58d3b07e72bb3439e23dc49f794be32.poster.avif?t=1782390627\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/c58d3b07e72bb3439e23dc49f794be32.webm?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/c58d3b07e72bb3439e23dc49f794be32.mp4?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-ended musical sandbox</strong>: Sequence up to 6 musicians simultaneously to create your own masterful compositions, with animations synced to your every note.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/69701794c413a0509c2a903d8c0e8f2c.poster.avif?t=1782390627\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/69701794c413a0509c2a903d8c0e8f2c.webm?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/extras/69701794c413a0509c2a903d8c0e8f2c.mp4?t=1782390627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Ultimate Drummer is an action-platformer where you play as a lone drummer on a sacred quest to restore harmony to a fractured world. Use a fully playable step-sequencer drum kit to reshape reality, awaken lost musicians, and bring music back to life.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Ultimate Drummer is filled with non-stop surprises, a twist for every beat.”<br>Kotaku<br><br>“It was consistently funny, festive, joyous, and also really unique. I've never seen a game like this.”<br>Iron Pineapple<br><br>“Ultimate Drummer is both a difficult game to talk about, and yet a game I desperately want to talk to everyone about. Because in the tradition of games like Frog Fractions and The Stanley Parable, the less you know about this game, the better.”<br>Noclip<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/54ed4cae5da81e1ab137e3bdc70ae80e60c1fcd9/header.jpg?t=1782390627", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/ab6cb09fe0cd3be9dc2a0c504dd1549941a34a7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782390627", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646020/ab6cb09fe0cd3be9dc2a0c504dd1549941a34a7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782390627", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-5820K, AMD Ryzen 5 2600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1080<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or Higher<br></li><li><strong>Process